{
  "additional_concerns": [
    "Exposure measurement, asset classification and designation applicability are delegated to supplied facts; no particular Fund's classification is established by this packet.",
    "The definition and derivative examples are absent from the executable representation. These are upstream assessment omissions, not established defects in the Boolean combination.",
    "The global CONFLICT block is an additional implementation restriction: a conflict on one route blocks evaluation even when the other route independently establishes classification. The circular does not impose that restriction.",
    "The source supplies no express classification grace period, effective-date rule or designation persistence rule. Assessment-time applicability requires evidence.",
    "The three unbound dependency IDs have no supplied authority mapping. None can safely be assigned to a named missing authority.",
    "LAF exclusion does not establish non-complex status. The separate LAF circular is missing but is unnecessary to apply this circular's exclusion.",
    "FALSE and OUT_OF_SCOPE do not establish overall compliance or absence of complex-product treatment under other authorities.",
    "Designation factors are non-exhaustive. The representation preserves reliance on an actual SFC designation but does not implement or reproduce the SFC's holistic assessment."
  ],
